The  program  restores dumped quota information to a file system.
The file should be in the format produced with The quotas,  expi‐
ration  times, and configured grace times listed in the dump file
are loaded into the named file system.  The argument should be  a
file  or directory on the file system, not a device special file.
If the option is given, quota entries on the file system that are
not mentioned in the dump file will be deleted.  Otherwise,  they
are left alone.  If the is not specified, standard input is used.
